  "description": "Weather is a current weather API that reports conditions for any city name or zip code: real-time temperature and wind speed with compass direction, in both metric and imperial units, with the location's coordinates, time zone and local time, day or night, and a UV risk level. Paid plans add a 7-day forecast with daily highs, lows, rain chance and conditions for the week ahead, and an optional hourly forecast.",
